1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900
Massajni sevasizmi?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,100
Men massajni juda sevaman

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,450
Shuning uchun assotsiatsiyada o’zimga

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,250
mana shunday pribor — biomassajyor xarid qildim

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,150
Bu shunchaki mo’jiza

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,400
Buni uyingiz uchun ham xarid qilsangiz bo’ladi

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,400
O’zingiz bilan olib yurish mumkin

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,300
Mana, qarang: remenchalari bor

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,200
taqdingiz — yelkaga osdingiz

10
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,250
qo’lda ushlab yursangiz ham bo’ladi

11
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,950
remenlari mana bunday taqiladi

12
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:38,000
u tomondan ham, bu tomondan ham

13
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,800
Xuddi kosmetichkaga o’xshaydi

14
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:44,300
grimyorlar sumkasini shunday taqib yuradi

15
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:47,100
taqib oldingiz — yurish qulay

16
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,000
Endi — ichidagi mo’jiza

17
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,950
Qarang, bu yerda nima bor:

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,300
tolalariga kumush o’tkazilgan

19
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:03,300
massaj uchun kumushli qo’lqop

20
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:12,850
Bular — ulash uchun provodlar

21
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:16,700
biomassajyor bir nechta funksiyaga ega

22
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,800
kumush qo’lqoplar qo’lga taqiladi

23
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:33,200
bu — elektr quvvati, rozetkaga ulanadi

24
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:40,450
Mana o’zi — biomassajyor

25
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,150
ajoyib, kichkinagina pribor

26
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,350
uni «qovoqcha» deb ham atashadi

27
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,300
Uni mana bunday o’rnatamiz

28
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:51,600
va hammasini birga ulaymiz

29
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:54,100
U funksiyasini o’zi bajaradi

30
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,500
funksiyalari — beshta

31
00:01:55,600 --> 00:02:00,000
massajni o’zi qilib beradi

32
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:04,950
Qo’lqop taqilsa — impuls massaj

33
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,700
guasha massaji

34
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:09,950
va hatto quruq hijoma

35
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:15,800
Yana mana bu kichkina nasadkasi bor

36
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:19,950
Quloq og’risa, burun bitib qolsa

37
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,100
uni ham davolashda ishlatiladi

38
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:34,500
Qo’l massajida charchab qolish mumkin

39
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,800
bu massajyor bilan esa hammasini o’zingiz

40
00:02:39,850 --> 00:02:44,600
bemalol, kuch sarflamasdan qilasiz

41
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,600
Men uni juda sevib qoldim

42
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:51,250
onamning oyoq tomirlari og’riydi

43
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:54,300
varikoz muammosini ketkazadi

44
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:56,200
oyoq tomirlarini

45
00:02:56,250 --> 00:02:59,000
ikki qavat ichkariga kirib ishlaydi

46
00:02:59,050 --> 00:03:02,900
nafaqat teri — ichki tomirlar bilan ham

47
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,800
U kichkina — sumkada olib yuring

48
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:07,700
bemalol ishlataverasiz

49
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:11,700
Fiziokabinet ochmoqchi bo’lsangiz —

50
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:14,300
bu zo’r imkoniyat, daromad qiling

51
00:03:14,350 --> 00:03:15,850
Tavsiya qilaman!
